# Words of Wind: "{1}: The next time you would draw a card this turn, each player returns a permanent they control to its
# owner's hand instead." (CR 614.1a, 611.2) Bot1 activates it once on turn 3 and casts Ancestral Recall. The first draw is
# replaced: in turn order each player chooses one of their permanents - Bot1 its tapped Mox Jet, Bot2 its Swamp - and both
# go to their owners' hands together (CR 101.4); the effect is then used up, so the second and third draws are drawn.

